#: ../../language/error_codes/E4184.md:1
msgid "E4184"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4184.md:3
msgid ""
"Compiler diagnostic name: "
"`start_rest_binder_is_not_supported_in_longest_match_strategy`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4184.md:5
msgid ""
"This diagnostic described a leading rest binder in the earlier lexical "
"pattern syntax and is not emitted by the current compiler. The "
"corresponding current binding error is [E4220](E4220.md)."
msgstr "この診断は以前の字句パターン構文における先頭の残余部分の束縛を説明するものであり、現在のコンパイラでは発生しません。現在対応する束縛エラーは [E4220](E4220.md) です。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4184.md:9
msgid ""
"In `lexmatch ... with longest`, each regex starts at the beginning of the"
" input, so `before=` is not available."
msgstr "`lexmatch ... with longest` では各正規表現が入力の先頭から始まるため、`before=` は利用できません。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4184.md:12
msgid "Erroneous example"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4184.md:14
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"pub fn match_text(text : String) -> Unit {\n"
"  lexmatch text with longest {\n"
"    (_, \"abc\", _) => ()\n"
"    _ => ()\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4184.md:18
msgid ""
"The first `_` attempts to bind or skip input before the `\"abc\"` regex "
"pattern."
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4184.md:20
msgid "Suggestion"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4184.md:22
msgid ""
"Use a `^`-anchored regex and bind only the suffix with `after=` when "
"needed."
msgstr "`^` で先頭に固定した正規表現を使い、必要な場合だけ `after=` で接尾部分を束縛してください。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4184.md:24
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"pub fn match_text(text : String) -> Unit {\n"
"  lexmatch text with longest {\n"
"    (re\"^abc\", after=_) => ()\n"
"    _ => ()\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
